/-!
# A060246

Triangle whose rows are the degrees of the irreducible representations of the groups PSL(2,p) as p runs through the primes.

The 80 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A060246

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 1, 3, 3,
    4, 5, 1, 3, 3, 6, 7, 8, 1, 5,
    5, 10, 10, 11, 12, 12, 1, 7, 7, 12,
    12, 12, 13, 14, 14, 1, 9, 9, 16, 16,
